---

This implementation ports semantics from @rochecompaan/pi-context-paging 0.3.11
(MIT License, Copyright Roché Compaan): the rolling-window cut policy, the paging
notice format (copied, never summarized, evicted conversation), and the exact-text
recovery tool behavior (16 KiB replies, part handles, deferred items). Those
portions remain subject to their original MIT terms.
